---
description: UI component layering and styling responsibilities.
globs:
  - "src/components/**/*.{ts,tsx,css}"
alwaysApply: true
---

- `components/ui`: primitives only; no feature-specific business behavior.
- `components/common`: shared composites used across features.
- `components/features/*`: domain-specific composition and presentation.
- Keep styling refactors local to the component layer; do not move route/data logic.
- Prefer CSS modules and tokenized Tailwind utilities; keep inline styles only when behavior-preserving and structurally required.
